| `src/ct/knowledge_graph/` | Fork-only. Neo4j + GraphRAG query layer. |
| `src/ct/memory/` | Fork-only. Vector memory store. |
| `src/ct/monitoring/` | Fork-only. Health/observability surfaces. |
| `src/ct/validation/` | Fork-only. Result validation modules. |
| `src/ct/campaign/` | Fork-only. Campaign orchestration. |
| `src/ct/generative/` | Fork-only. Generative chemistry modules. |
| `src/ct/security/` | Fork-only. Auth, API keys, secrets, RBAC helpers. **Largely unwired — see docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md.** |
| `src/ct/session_logging/` | Fork-only. Session trace persistence. |
| `src/ct/agents/` | Fork-only. Specialist agent definitions. |
